    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__QuoteLine__c records with negative SBQQ__NetTotal__c.
Why it matters: A negative line on a quote either reflects an unintended credit or a math bug. Either way it goes to the customer as a credit they didn&apos;t expect, and the deal P&amp;L is wrong.
Suppress a finding: when the negative line is an intentional credit/rebate captured as a quote line.
Disable the detector: only when credits-via-quote-lines are normal. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
